Never build, install, or uninstall the Omalauncher APK in this repository. Forbidden:
`./gradlew :app:assembleDebug`, `:app:assembleRelease`, `:app:installDebug`, `:app:bundle*`,
`./gradlew build`, `./scripts/fetch-proot.sh`, `adb install`, `adb uninstall dev.omalauncher`.
Allowed: reading/editing sources, `./gradlew :owl:test :app:testDebugUnitTest`,
`./gradlew :owl:owlJar`. See AGENTS.md for the full rule and rationale.
